---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: 14px
    primaryColor: "#e8f1fb"
    primaryBorderColor: "#6d9ed3"
    primaryTextColor: "#0b2a4a"
    lineColor: "#333333"
    noteBkgColor: "#ffffff"
    noteBorderColor: "#ffffff"
    noteTextColor: "#666666"
    actorBkg: "#e8f1fb"
    actorBorder: "#6d9ed3"
  themeCSS: >-
    svg, text, tspan, span, p, div { font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important; }
    .noteText, .noteText tspan { font-weight: 600; fill: #222 !important; font-size: 15px !important; }
    .labelText, .loopText, .loopText tspan { font-weight: bold; fill: #444 !important; }
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as Renter
  participant API as Booking API
  participant MM as Matchmaker
  participant SIG as Connection setup
  participant PC as Gaming PC

  R->>API: choose a game and book it (signed in with Steam)
  API->>MM: find a machine for this booking
  MM->>MM: pick a free gaming PC and reserve it
  MM-->>R: machine ready
  R->>SIG: connect
  SIG->>PC: renter is coming
  SIG-->>R: direct connection to the gaming PC
  PC->>PC: start Steam and the game
  PC->>R: stream the game
  R->>PC: play
